# Publish only the web app (index.html + assets/). Everything else stays local.
*

!.gitignore
!index.html
!assets/
!assets/*.jpg
!assets/*.png

# Never publish: real production data, reference PDFs, local tooling, backups.
# (covered by the blanket "*" above — listed here so the intent is explicit)
# รายงานน้ำและไฟฟ้า/ รายงานผลวิเคราะห์น้ำตาล/ รายงานหยุดหีบ/  → factory Excel data
# Sugar Tech/ Boiler/                                        → copyrighted PDFs, skill files
# Background*.png icon.png                                   → multi-MB source images
# index.html.bak                                             → pre-optimization backup
